          "x": 683,
          "y": 468,
          "width": 293,
          "height": 88,
          "z": 10
        },
        "label": "\u00abrequirement\u00bb\nREQ-T-012 Thermal Cutoff\nDisable heating if internal\ntemperature exceeds a safe threshold.",
        "style": "requirement"
      },
      {
        "id": "browningLevelsRequirement",
